==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 4 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Mega Medicham ex Drop Event]], which ran from February 12 to 22, 2026.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Ralts|74}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*{{m|Draining Kiss}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Ralts}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

